    "body": "The `createURL` function should not set the page because otherwise it will trigger a search every time it's called. The function must generate the URL that matches the provided value. You can take a look at the implementation inside [`connectMenu`](https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/blob/develop/src/connectors/menu/connectMenu.js#L182-L183).",
